{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1138559-freshly-awakened-mages","id":1138559,"title":"Freshly awakened mages","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-08T05:40:49-07:00","id":1138559,"title":"Freshly awakened mages","content":"So a friend and I were talking about a particular concept for a game involving a group of mages awaking at a National LARP event run by mage using the the Free counsel merit Techne (we figure you could use LARP for techne - just go with it).<br /> <br /> For this game the players would have to play as very freshly awakened mages (as in practically awakening in play), rather than the just out of their apprenticeship represented by the gen rules in the core book. What stats would you give a newly awakened mage with no training at all. we thought about just not giving them access to an order or maybe giving them fewer Arcana dots (but that might lock them into their path arcana a bit much),<br /> <br /> What to people think?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12845_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-08T05:47:35-07:00","id":1138560,"title":"","content":"The benefits of Order training are three Rotes, a dot of Occult, and a dot of Order status. In the Mysterium book there's a blurb on the arcana of a new Mage, I think it's 2 dots in one ruling arcana and one dot in the other ruling arcana.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-08T05:54:54-07:00","id":1138561,"title":"","content":"No order, no rotes, possibly no dedicated tool. In 2E a mage has to start with at least 2 dots in one ruling arcanum, one in another and one in a third non-inferior arcarnum, so you could say that's what they come back from the watchtower with. <br /> <br /> One thing that can apparently happen now is showing back up from your awakening with an artifact you picked up during it, so that merit's potentially available. Might be useful way of giving your new mages a leg up if you're planning to start playing them before they're ripe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-08T08:16:21-07:00","id":1138585,"title":"","content":"Fresh after Awakening, a Mage has one dot in each Path Arcanum and a free dot in a Resistance Attribute. Everything else represents Order training.<br /> <br /> E: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/177100-how-much-in-game-time-do-mages-learn-new-arcana-points\">Or not. </a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2855,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","user":"Axelgear","date":". 09-08-2017, 11:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}